+# The Daily Grind
+
+Run `pnpm start` to serve the static homepage. Run `pnpm test` for the media loading checks.
+
+All players begin with `preload="none"` and only inert `data-src` / `data-poster` URLs. `media.js` attaches their sources and posters and enables metadata preloading when they are within 200px of the viewport. An IntersectionObserver handles this once per player; a scroll/resize fallback preserves deferral in older browsers. No media resource hints or CSS background images fetch the posters ahead of the players.
+
+The hero is muted and loops, with a play/pause button. Reduced-motion and data-saving preferences disable automatic playback. The roasting video and podcast use native controls and never autoplay. Layout dimensions reserve space before media loads.
+
+## Media sources
+
+- Hero: [Pouring coffee in a cup, Mixkit](https://mixkit.co/free-stock-video/pouring-coffee-in-a-cup-43941/).
+- Roasting: [Roasting coffee, Mixkit](https://mixkit.co/free-stock-video/roasting-coffee-12479/). This sample is under the Mixkit Restricted License (personal use only); replace it with owned or commercially licensed roasting footage before commercial publication.
+- Posters: Unsplash photos `1495474472287-4d71bcdd2085` and `1447933601403-0c6688de566e`.
+- Podcast: [Home Coffee Roasting, part 1, by dnt, Hacker Public Radio #3563](https://hackerpublicradio.org/eps/hpr3563/index.html), CC BY-SA 4.0; used unchanged with attribution beside the player.
+
+Media remains hosted by third parties. Tests cover initial source/poster deferral, viewport activation, activation only once, autoplay preferences, and the observer fallback. No manual browser verification was performed.
